#     subfolders at most, the first file of a name kept, hidden / system / linked folders never looked into), Remote "Sub/X.nsp" (CopyFromFolder and the cover pass append it to the folder), the
#     summary and the clashes in the log ("cloud: N game files in <source> and its M subfolders"). FetchCloudIcons reads the control NCA's id too (GameIconsStream.Read(keys, stream, out id)) and
